{"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation"],"anchor":"Presenting-to-Safari","title":"Presenting to Safari"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentingtosafari"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Answer a web page’s request for an mdoc over the Digital Credentials","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"API, as an iOS document provider.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"From iOS 26, a page in Safari can ask for an ISO mdoc with the W3C"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Digital Credentials API, using the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"org-iso-mdoc"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol (ISO\/IEC TS"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"18013-7 Annex C). iOS offers the apps that registered a matching"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"document, and shows the chosen app’s document provider extension for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the holder’s consent. The extension answers through"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startMdocPresentation(requestData:origin:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/respond(shown:readerCertificate:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"; the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"response goes back through Safari, encrypted to the page, with no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"network request from the wallet."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Safari sends only "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"org-iso-mdoc"},{"type":"text","text":", not OpenID4VP, and on iOS only:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Safari on macOS has no document providers."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Set-up-the-app-and-its-extension","text":"Set up the app and its extension","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The extension:"}]},{"text":" a target whose Info.plist names the extension","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"point ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.apple.identity-document-services.document-provider-ui"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EXAppExtensionAttributes"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EXExtensionPointIdentifier"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The capability:"}]},{"text":" Digital Credentials API – Mobile Document","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Provider, on both the app’s and the extension’s App IDs, with the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doctypes the app presents in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.apple.developer.identity-document-services.document-provider.mobile-document-types"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entitlement. Apple allows only certain doctypes, such as the ISO mDL","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and Photo ID.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Shared storage:"}]},{"text":" the extension is another process, so the app","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"keeps its credentials in an App Group both list","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore\/inAppGroup(_:options:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":"), and its holder keys in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a Keychain access group both list","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderAccessGroup","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":"). Instance and DPoP","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"keys stay in the app’s own group: the extension presents, but doesn’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"receive. The app saves its configuration where the extension can","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"read it too.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"code":["import Foundation","import IdentityDocumentServices","import IdentityDocumentServicesUI","import OID4VCWallet","import SwiftUI","","\/\/\/ What the app and its document provider extension share.","enum SharedWallet {","    static let appGroup = \"group.com.example.wallet\"","    static let holderKeyGroup = \"ABCDE12345.com.example.wallet.shared\"","","    \/\/\/ The configuration the app saved in the group's defaults.","    static func configuration() throws -> WalletConfiguration {","        guard let data = UserDefaults(suiteName: appGroup)?.data(forKey: \"configuration\") else { throw CocoaError(.fileNoSuchFile) }","        return try JSONDecoder().decode(WalletConfiguration.self, from: data)","    }","","    \/\/\/ The wallet over the shared store and holder keys: the app passes","    \/\/\/ its Wallet Provider; the extension, which only presents, nil.","    static func open(provider: (any WalletProvider)?) throws -> Wallet {","        try Wallet(","            configuration: try configuration(),","            keyStore: KeychainKeyStore(options: .init(holderAccessGroup: holderKeyGroup)),","            credentialStore: try FileCredentialStore.inAppGroup(appGroup),","            provider: provider)","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Register-the-documents","text":"Register the documents","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iOS offers the app only for documents it registered. Whenever the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credentials change, register each presentable mdoc and remove the rest."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"supportedAuthorityKeyIdentifiers"},{"type":"text","text":" names the reader CAs, by subject key"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identifier, whose requests the document answers."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["\/\/\/ Registers the held mdocs of `doctypes` with iOS, so Safari offers the","\/\/\/ app for them. The first registration asks the holder to allow it.","@available(iOS 26.0, *)","func registerDocuments(_ credentials: [CredentialSummary], doctypes: Set<String>, readerAuthorities: [Data]) async throws {","    let store = IdentityDocumentProviderRegistrationStore()","    for registration in try await store.registrations {","        try await store.removeRegistration(forDocumentIdentifier: registration.documentIdentifier)","    }","    for credential in credentials where credential.format == \"mso_mdoc\" && doctypes.contains(credential.doctype ?? \"\") {","        try await store.addRegistration(MobileDocumentRegistration(","            mobileDocumentType: credential.doctype ?? \"\",","            supportedAuthorityKeyIdentifiers: readerAuthorities,","            documentIdentifier: credential.id,","            invalidationDate: credential.validUntil))","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Answer-in-the-extension","text":"Answer in the extension","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iOS hands the extension the request in two stages. First,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ISO18013MobileDocumentRequestContext.request"},{"type":"text","text":" describes what’s asked,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the consent screen: show it with the website’s origin, and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"candidates from "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/mdocCandidates(origin:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Only when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holder shares does iOS release the request itself, to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sendResponse"},{"type":"text","text":"‘s closure. Validate it there, parse it, check it’s what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the holder was shown, and answer."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["@available(iOS 26.0, *)","struct WalletDocumentProvider: IdentityDocumentProvider {","    var body: some IdentityDocumentRequestScene {","        ISO18013MobileDocumentRequestScene { context in","            ConsentView(context: context)","        }","    }","","    func performRegistrationUpdates() async {}","}","","@available(iOS 26.0, *)","struct ConsentView: View {","    let context: ISO18013MobileDocumentRequestContext","    @State private var problem: String?","    \/\/\/ The candidate shared, from `Wallet.mdocCandidates(origin:)`.","    @State private var chosen: CredentialSummary?","","    \/\/\/ The request's first document as iOS parsed it: what the consent","    \/\/\/ screen shows the holder.","    private var shown: (doctype: String, elements: [MdocPresentation.Element])? {","        guard let document = context.request.presentmentRequests.first?.documentRequestSets.first?.requests.first else {","            return nil","        }","        let elements = document.namespaces.flatMap { namespace, elements in","            elements.map { MdocPresentation.Element(namespace: namespace, identifier: $0.key, retain: $0.value.isRetaining) }","        }","        return (document.documentType, elements)","    }","","    var body: some View {","        VStack {","            if let problem { Text(problem) }","            if chosen?.linkableHere == true { Text(\"This website could link this to another.\") }","            Button(\"Share\") { Task { await share() } }.disabled(chosen == nil)","            Button(\"Cancel\") { context.cancel() }","        }","        .task {","            guard let shown, let originURL = context.requestingWebsiteOrigin,","                  let origin = MdocPresentation.origin(of: originURL) else { return }","            chosen = try? await SharedWallet.open(provider: nil).mdocCandidates(origin: origin)","                .first { $0.doctype == shown.doctype }","        }","    }","","    \/\/\/ Shares the chosen mdoc, for exactly the document and elements the","    \/\/\/ holder was shown.","    func share() async {","        guard let shown, let chosen, let originURL = context.requestingWebsiteOrigin,","              let origin = MdocPresentation.origin(of: originURL) else { return }","        let agreed = MdocPresentation.Shown(doctype: shown.doctype, elements: shown.elements,","                                            credentialID: chosen.id, toldLinkable: chosen.linkableHere == true)","        do {","            let wallet = try SharedWallet.open(provider: nil)","            try await context.sendResponse { raw in","                _ = try IdentityDocumentWebPresentmentRawRequestValidator()","                    .validateISO18013MobileDocumentRequest(raw.requestData, origin: originURL)","                let presentation = try await wallet.startMdocPresentation(requestData: raw.requestData, origin: origin)","                \/\/ Answer only what the holder was shown, or throw","                \/\/ RequestChanged. The holder key signs now: Face ID, if","                \/\/ the key store asks.","                let response = try await presentation.respond(shown: [agreed], readerCertificate: nil)","                return ISO18013MobileDocumentResponse(responseData: response.response)","            }","        } catch {","            \/\/ Nothing was shared: say so, and let the holder cancel.","            problem = \"Not shared: \\(error)\"","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/respond(shown:readerCertificate:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" answers the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"elements the holder was shown, not those the released request names,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and refuses, with "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/RequestChanged","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", a request that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"changed in between: a shown document no longer asked for, or asked for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with other elements; a chosen credential that no longer answers it; or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one that became linkable here when the holder wasn’t told"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/Shown\/toldLinkable","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"). Where the consent screen"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"names the reader (below), pass that reader’s certificate as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"readerCertificate"},{"type":"text","text":", and a request signed by any other is refused too."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/Request-swift.struct\/answers(for:readerCertificate:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" makes the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same check without answering. The demo wallet’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DocumentProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"target does all of this, with several documents, a choice of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credential and a linkability warning."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Name-the-reader","text":"Name the reader","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A page’s request may be signed by its reader’s certificate (ISO\/IEC"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"18013-5 reader authentication). When the certificate chains to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRoots","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/Request-swift.struct\/reader","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"names it; otherwise show only the website’s origin."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRequireEKU","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" accepts only certificates"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"issued for readers, and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requireTrustedMdocReader","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refuses requests from any other reader before the holder sees them."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Warn-of-linkable-presentations","text":"Warn of linkable presentations","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each candidate’s "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/linkableHere","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" says whether"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presenting it would hand this website a copy another website has seen,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/Response\/linkable","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" whether it did. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"extension doesn’t refresh used-up copies: have the app do it when it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"next becomes active, after listing its credentials again."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"Presenting to Safari"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingToSafari"},"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/requireTrustedMdocReader":{"title":"requireTrustedMdocReader","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Refuses an ","type":"text"},{"code":"org-iso-mdoc","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" request no recognized reader signed:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"startMdocPresentation","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" throws "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"untrustedVerifier"},{"type":"text","text":", and nothing is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shown to the holder. Needs "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"mdocReaderRoots"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"requireTrustedMdocReader","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/requiretrustedmdocreader","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requireTrustedMdocReader","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore/Options-swift.struct/holderAccessGroup":{"title":"holderAccessGroup","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The Keychain access group holder keys are made in, when the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app shares them with an extension — a document provider"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"presenting credentials, say — that lists the group in its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"keychain-access-groups"},{"text":" entitlement. Instance and DPoP keys","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stay in the app’s default group: only the app issues. nil:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"every key is in the default group.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"holderAccessGroup","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore\/options-swift.struct\/holderaccessgroup","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderAccessGroup","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/MdocPresentation/respond(shown:readerCertificate:)":{"title":"respond(shown:readerCertificate:)","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Answers the request with what the holder was shown","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/Request-swift.struct\/answers(for:readerCertificate:)","type":"reference"},{"text":"): ","type":"text"},{"code":"respond(answers:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"once the check passes.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"respond"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"shown"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet16MdocPresentationC5ShownV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Shown"},{"kind":"text","text":"], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"readerCertificate"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Data"},{"kind":"text","text":"?) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet16MdocPresentationC8ResponseV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Response"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/mdocpresentation\/respond(shown:readercertificate:)","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/respond(shown:readerCertificate:)"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/mdocCandidates(origin:)":{"title":"mdocCandidates(origin:)","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The held mdocs, each with whether the page at "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origin"},{"text":" has been","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"shown it and whether presenting it there now would be linkable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"shownToVerifier"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"linkableHere"},{"text":"): for a document provider’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"consent screen, shown before iOS releases the request itself.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MdocPresentation.request"},{"text":" says the same once it has.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mdocCandidates","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"origin","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"CredentialSummary","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet17CredentialSummaryV"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/mdoccandidates(origin:)","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/mdocCandidates(origin:)"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/CredentialSummary/linkableHere":{"title":"linkableHere","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Whether presenting it to the Verifier asking would hand it a copy","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"another Verifier has seen. Set only on a presentation’s candidates.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"linkableHere"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/credentialsummary\/linkablehere","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/linkableH